{"v":4,"catch":"“是的，SHOGUN。” Sasuke，從敵人的忍者手中拯救將軍！","desc":"“SASUKE VS COMMANDER”是SNK在1980年發布的射擊遊戲。\n成為忍者佐助並擊敗試圖殺死幕府將軍的敵方忍者。\n忍者首領使用各種忍術進行攻擊，因此請冷靜評估自己的模式並進行反擊！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-03-05","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6f03a75da6de538c46da4ec8ad848aee155070b295185d8e25d546457c4bdeda.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a3fcb7fbf359993fa9e75f370cb61916a56d1d9f8470552a525bbf8f37c1a4f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26521f338ab4b96deba76289842d3d96f9e294e9a5eafbbccf978b8085665c33.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5eb4eafe02b5e43380f07b2f441001843c7d7388b46a1265f5e7cc5e754d2a06.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d107c03aed7a8e0f9406f45408af897daeee010c0bf6719db0914d00ff5a0a17.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/37c58160b41a98baad384af3d1aa55fc516fb86f436f6d8e7823ca30ddc9aa79.jpg"],"titleId":"0100aa600c8d6000","dlc":[]}